    "summary": "Strategic Ploy, 1 CP, in the [Fight phase](vsdata:core-rule/fight-phase) of either turn, just before one of your TYRANIDS units Consolidates; that unit is the target. Until the phase ends, whenever it Consolidates its models may go 3″ further, provided the unit can finish in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of at least one enemy unit. If instead the unit is inside your army's Synapse Range and out of Engagement Range of all enemies, it may swap that Consolidation move for a Normal move covering no more than 6″.",
